**The smallest fix** goes in `js/spine-edit.js` `S.planAddMusic`. It adds a picture video picked as music as sound only, the way `FM.extractAudio` does:

```js
made.forEach(l => {
  if (!(l.sm && l.sm.snd)) { l.audioOnly = true; l.transform.opacity = 0; S.setFlag(l, 'snd', true); l.muted = false; }   // a picture video picked as music: its sound only (DESIGN §3.6.1 sound draws nothing; Full's Audio tab, queue 448)
